  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "允頭路"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>藍春瑞</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我照新聞啟事ê地址，行入去一間不止仔有派頭ê公司beh允頭路，tsit箍lóng無擔頭ê老闆，kā桌頂ê履歷書類tsîn tsiânn久，tsiah用hit款bē啥kah意ê khuì口問一寡有--ê無--ê，像講你lóng m̄ bat食過頭路，kám有才調做外務、收貨款？Tiānn-tiānn無晝無暗、無年無節ê khang-khuè，ē ha̍h--無？你讀大學，一月日趁兩萬二ê月給，kám bē克虧著你？問煞我隨tsiânn細膩仔回話，講kap人客tsih接、puânn-nuá ê khang-khuè，tio̍h-ài骨力走、綿爛tsông就做有路來，tse我ē-hiáu；koh再講我無某無猴，m̄免飼老爸、老母，一人飽規家飽，應該有ha̍h；面會自án-ne到tsia煞，叫我tńg去thìng候通知。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">行來車牌仔跤，就有bá-suh leh等，司機鉸票ê時tsūn笑bi-bi請我tsiūnn車，koh有位thang坐，來到火車頭mā隨有車tsuā thang盤；tī車廂內，心肝iáu暢暢，想講niáu鼠鑽入去牛角，穩tak-tak，後過ê食穿lóng免啥煩惱--ah。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">隔tńg工我lóng m̄敢烏白走，連suà五工目睭lóng nih-nih看，leh等電話聲tân--起-來，hit種燒lō真正m̄是燥pia̍k-pia̍k niâ，顛倒是hah kah tshia̍k-tshia̍k-tiô，bē輸鬼掠無著hit一樣。Khah ē知影第六工透早仝款無影跡ê時tsūn，人就有淡薄仔鬱卒，心肝冷一kue̍h--去，總--是賰一點khuì絲仔ê ǹg望，iáu有leh to̍h。到第七工，連上尾hit點火星mā即時hua--去，規个人忝kah kiōng-beh斷khuì，bē輸é-káu硩死囝，有話無tè講。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kám ē我面骨夯夯、兼khok頭，koh生做hit款免戴siáu鬼仔殼就ē-tàng去掠妖ê歹看面ê緣故，莫怪頭家看bē tsiūnn目；iah是我本底to腹肚空空，親像phànn蟳無膏án-ne，三、兩句話就hōo人看破跤手，一聲就píng爿tshia畚斗，lóng免koh哭iau--ah。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Koh隔一個月，為著bē ài「大學」tsit兩个衰尾字kā我kenn跤kenn手，tsheh心走去一間水電公司允頭路ê時tsūn，我刁工剃hái-kat仔頭、穿一雙舊布鞋，講是高中出業ê庄跤囡仔，tsiah做兵tńg--來，料bē到tsit箍頭家人仔，連證書mā無看，一聲就叫我明仔載來上班。我家己leh暗想，是m̄是我hōo人看--起-來就是tsiah高中ê學歷，無hit種大學生ê pān勢，tsiah ē水tīnn船浮，一必一中。M̄-koh，若beh稽考tsit內底有啥mih緣故leh pìnn鬼pìnn怪，我就無真知--ah。&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">（Tsit篇文章bat刊tī教育部電子報，漢羅用字有調整，原文網址：<a href=\"https://reurl.cc/a48ZQ4\" target=\"_blank\">https://reurl.cc/a48ZQ4</a>）</p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span></span><span><!--more--></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiyB9NrZByUo1bFxEkQ9LtnHokv9PtmSqUZ6yw0-lEA2agRmyEkXrfXORAA4gb3xrkxCw8gWNZ1uRF7q2i2hHqAZCJayAP8E_MpDpglK6fCr-fBGgjLWRWvPrdAlb4k8ZtGlz_hw1o8HNJXRXRd9u-bndCSmIEZHPTOeCAuzBnWGcDpu2XMtlMcO55rKIk1/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1356%E6%9C%9F_%E9%BB%91%E7%99%BD%E5%85%A7%E9%A0%8148%E9%A0%818.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiyB9NrZByUo1bFxEkQ9LtnHokv9PtmSqUZ6yw0-lEA2agRmyEkXrfXORAA4gb3xrkxCw8gWNZ1uRF7q2i2hHqAZCJayAP8E_MpDpglK6fCr-fBGgjLWRWvPrdAlb4k8ZtGlz_hw1o8HNJXRXRd9u-bndCSmIEZHPTOeCAuzBnWGcDpu2XMtlMcO55rKIk1/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1356%E6%9C%9F_%E9%BB%91%E7%99%BD%E5%85%A7%E9%A0%8148%E9%A0%818.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhRi0MHnBNk0HBASI7PHqJn-eiJu6TwKxlcmHxNdD2xlfGwjZl1GqqdNfaZKh03liMs1QOvSFFPcPJIuyxa27S0nz91WgqjxjcRXJDxjVcfYrv7B15qXMlcuA0bN1Jb1Ki55qFbDvpnWZJF-azmzG1FT-l7eDDn7d2aHPQTLIK_r_J0AU1zfoq4E63ThLxp/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1356%E6%9C%9F_07.jpg\" imag